  "body": "Some properties are simply in a league of their own. This is one of them!\r\n\r\nShowcasing spectacular panoramic views across the Hauraki Gulf to Rangitoto, this palatial property offers an extraordinary combination of space, lifestyle and flexibility, with three separate living components ideal for multi-generational families.\r\nThe main residence features five bedrooms, three bathrooms and expansive open-plan living, flowing seamlessly to stunning outdoor entertaining areas, a heated swimming pool and exceptional spaces to relax and enjoy the views. Add a games room, gym and double internal-access garage, and you have family living on a grand scale.\r\n\r\nBut there's more! Two additional units providing incredible flexibility. A two-bedroom self-contained with its own kitchen, bathroom and laundry, plus a separate two-bedroom granny flat with kitchenette. Perfect for grandparents, adult children, extended family, guests or additional income.\r\n\r\nWith parking for six or more vehicles, outstanding school zones and beaches, shopping, cafes and transport all close by, this is a property that truly caters for every stage of family life.\r\n\r\nThree separate living spaces, breathtaking views and room for the whole family. Opportunities like this are exceptionally rare!\r\n\r\nFeatures and Benefits\r\nMain house:  \r\n* 5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms\r\n* Open plan kitchen / dining / living\r\n* Panoramic sea views and Rangitoto\r\n* Multiple living areas, indoor and out\r\n* Games room, gym, putting/chipping green\r\n* Heated swimming pool\r\n* Double garage with internal access plus multiple off-street parking (boat, camper van etc)\r\n* Tons of storage and a shooting range\r\n* Self-contained:  2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, kitchen, laundry\r\n* Granny flat: 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, kitchenette\r\n* Proximity to shopping, cafes, restaurants, public transport, motorway access, medical facilities, beaches\r\n* Zoned for double Westlake,  TNIS, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Wairau Intermediate, and Campbells Bay Schools\r\n\r\nCall Team Roberts to experience it for yourself.\r\n\r\nFor further information, please check this link: https://harcourts.net/L41194517\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale: 17th December at 4:00pm (USP)",
